msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_on_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_on_payroll.source_wsib_calculate
msgid ""
"Premium = gross insurable earnings x premium rate / 100; earnings above the "
"annual maximum of a worker are not reported."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_on_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,verification_note:l10n_ca_on_payroll.source_wsib_report_pay
msgid ""
"Quarterly due dates: April 30, July 31, October 31 and January 31 (months "
"confirmed, days to confirm against this page). Monthly: end of the following"
" month, to confirm against this page."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_ca_on_payroll
#: model:l10n_ca.payroll.source,summary:l10n_ca_on_payroll.source_wsib_frequency
msgid ""
"Reporting frequency from the estimated annual insurable earnings: monthly "
"from 1,000,000, quarterly from 20,000 to 999,999.99, annual below 20,000 (by"
" the end of April); annual reconciliation of the monthly reporters by March "
"31."
msgstr ""

